                                "sense_id": "0ff0d193-e10f-3629-843f-23c22164e9c0",
                                "text": "A UHF tuner having 70 detent positions with fine tuning capability at all locations. Coarse tuning is accomplished via a toothed, detented disk and a spirally-extending rim having a follower lever operable therewith."
                            }
                        ]
